  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>]</mo></math> denote the greatest integer <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>(</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>(</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will be discontinuous at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mn>1</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>8</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>(</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>.</p>"
  }
